{
  "sourceLanguage" : "zh-Hans",
  "strings" : {
    "-" : {

    },
    "-1" : {

    },
    "【ICM提示】目前正处于SNG 策略模拟器的泡沫期(3人)，积分的生存价值远大于积分的赢取价值，建议打得更紧一些，尤其是面对大积分玩家时。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[ICM] You are on the SNG Strategy Simulator bubble (3 players). Survival is key. Tighten up, especially against the point leader."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【位置提示】你在 %@ 位置。在 SNG 策略模拟器前期，深积分可以多打位置优势，避免在不利位置过度下注。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[Position] You are in the %@ position. In early SNG Strategy Simulator stages, leverage position and avoid inflating total points out of position."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【单挑提示】进入Heads-Up阶段，牌值大幅缩水，任何对子或两张高牌都值得激进游戏。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[Heads-Up] In HU play, hand values shift. Any pair or two broadway cards should be played aggressively."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【短筹提示】你目前的积分深度(%@BB)已进入All-in/Fold阶段，寻找机会直接全押而不是平跟。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[Short Stack] With %@ BBs, you are in the All-in/Fold zone. Look for shove spots instead of calling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
