    "在后位或小盲位，通过加注向盲注施压。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apply pressure to the blinds by raising from late position or the small blind."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在大盲位面对偷盲加注，决定跟注、3Bet或弃牌。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Decide whether to call, 3Bet, or fold when facing a steal raise in the big blind."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在按钮位平跟等于把主动权拱手让给大盲，极易被利用位置反打。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Flat calling on the button surrenders initiative to the big blind, easily inviting a squeeze play."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在极佳的底池赔率下弃掉了一手有潜力的好牌，太可惜了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's a pity to fold a hand with such good potential given the excellent pot odds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在短码阶段，只跟注是不好的策略。你应该全押(Push)或者弃牌(Fold)来最大化你的弃牌率。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In the short stack phase, calling is a poor strategy. You should Push or Fold to maximize fold equity."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在短码阶段拿到可玩性手牌果断全押，可以最大化弃牌率（Fold Equity）。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Decisively shoving playable hands in the short stack phase maximizes your Fold Equity."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在这个位置放弃强牌有点可惜了。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's a pity to fold such a strong hand from this position."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在这个回报率下跟注或全押是不划算的。长期来看这是负EV的决定。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Calling or shoving with these reward odds is unprofitable. It's a negative EV decision in the long run."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "坚果下注太小" : {
