    "大盲位拿到弱牌盲目反加是资金粉碎机。防守要有度，不要变成情绪化玩家。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Blindly re-raising weak hands from the BB is a chip shredder. Defend reasonably; don't play emotionally."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "大盲位有防守折扣，用同花连张或中等牌力跟注看翻牌是正 EV 的打法。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The BB gets a discount. Calling with suited connectors or medium strength hands is a +EV play."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "大盲位防守范围太窄，面对 CO 或按钮位加注弃牌过多，损失了防守价值。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
