    "很好，没有因为舍不得已经投入的大盲注而陷入“沉没成本”陷阱。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Good job avoiding the 'sunk cost' fallacy over your posted big blind."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "很好的 3Bet 尺度！你利用优质手牌建立了足够的底池并隔离了对手。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Good 3Bet sizing! You built a solid pot with a premium hand and isolated your opponent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "很好的偷盲加注！在偷盲位置，用宽范围施压是极佳的策略。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Great steal raise! Applying pressure with a wide range from a steal position is an excellent strategy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "很好的偷盲加注！在庄家或小盲位，用宽范围施压是极佳的策略。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Great steal raise! Applying pressure with a wide range from the button or small blind is an excellent strategy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "很好的极化下注，要么是坚果要么是空气，让对手非常难受。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Great polarized sizing—either very strong or a bluff—putting the opponent in a tough spot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "很好的纪律性。不强行偷盲，避免了被紧凶玩家剥削。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Great discipline. Not forcing a steal prevents you from being exploited by tight-aggressive players."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "很好的防守反击。让偷盲者陷入困境，这才是盲注防守的核心。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Great defensive counter-attack. Putting stealers in tough spots is the core of blind defense."
          }
        }
      }
    },
