        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hand History"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手牌偏弱，这里跟注前位加注会让你在翻后面临困难，建议弃牌。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your hand is too weak. Calling an early position raise here will put you in a tough spot post-flop. Recommend folding."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手牌很强，只选择跟注过于被动了。这里应该 3Bet 来压榨价值并夺取主动权。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your hand is very strong; just calling is too passive. You should 3Bet to extract value and seize the initiative."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手牌胜率太低了，这种回报率下强行入池就是在白白送积分。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your hand equity is too low. Forcing a call with these reward odds is just giving away points."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手牌详情" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hand Details"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手牌这么强，你应该加注建立底池。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With such a strong hand, you should raise to build the pot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打得太紧" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Too Tight"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打得太紧了，好牌也要敢于出手积累优势。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Playing too tight. You must be willing to build the pot with strong hands."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打法过于保守，放弃了巨大的价值获取机会，这在长期是不可持续的。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Too conservative. Giving up massive value opportunities is unsustainable in the long run."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "投入 \\(amount)" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bet \\(amount)"
          }
