      }
    },
    "投入 %lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bet %lld"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "投入 %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拿到 AA/KK 时翻前仅平跟，未能通过 3-bet 隔离，多人池胜率会大幅下降。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Flat calling AA/KK preflop fails to isolate. Multi-way pot equity drops significantly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拿到 KK/AA 过于保守，实际上翻前你应该更激进地进行加注或反加。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Playing KK/AA too passively. You should be much more aggressive preflop with raises and 3-bets."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拿到中等对子跟注寻求暗三条是可以的，但要注意筹码深度是否提供足够的隐含赔率。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set-mining with a medium pair is fine, but ensure the stack depth offers sufficient implied odds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拿到优质手牌过于保守，没有把握住筹码翻倍的绝佳机会。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Too conservative with a premium hand. You missed a perfect opportunity to double up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拿到好牌就要主动出击！过牌跟注容易让听牌便宜过关。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Take the initiative with good hands! Checking and calling allows draws to realize their equity cheaply."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拿到小牌且非同色，即便赔率再好也不应跟注。防守范围太宽容易导致翻后破产。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Offsuit small cards shouldn't be called despite good odds. Defending too wide leads to postflop disaster."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拿到强牌时翻前仅平跟，未能通过 3-bet 隔离成单挑底池，会导致多人池胜率下降。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Flat calling with a strong hand fails to isolate via a 3-bet, reducing your equity in a multi-way pot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按钮位过于保守！未利用位置优势放宽同花连张或小对子。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Too conservative on the button! You didn't leverage position to widen your range for suited connectors or small pairs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
