    "理智的弃牌。牌力太弱时不要被短码焦虑冲昏头脑强行全下。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rational fold. Don't let short-stack anxiety push you to shove a weak hand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "理智的跟注防守。但要注意，翻后如果没有击中强牌，不要盲目纠缠。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rational call defense. Just remember: if you miss the flop, don't blindly stick around."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用 AA/KK 在大盲位只跟注，给了加注玩家太好的隐含赔率去击中两对或三条。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just calling with AA/KK in the big blind gives the raiser great implied odds to hit two pair or a set."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用 AA/KK 在大盲位只跟注，给了按钮位玩家太好的隐含赔率去击中两对或三条。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Flatting AA/KK from the BB gives the button incredible implied odds to hit two pair or a set."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用中等牌力或同花连张全下作为半诈唬，具有一定的弃牌率，但风险较高。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shoving medium strength hands or suited connectors as a semi-bluff generates fold equity, but it carries high risk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用垃圾牌偷盲一旦被跟注，翻后处于不利位置的决策将极为困难。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
