          }
        }
      }
    },
    "追牌需要考虑回报率。这里的赔率不足以支撑你的听牌或弱牌，果断弃牌才是正解。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chasing draws requires good reward odds. The odds here don't justify calling with your draw or weak hand; folding is the right play."
