    "非常坚决的 Push。处于短码时，避免被动跟注，主动出击是最好的防守。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Very resolute Push. When short-stacked, avoid passive calls; attacking is the best defense."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "非常暴力的反击！用强牌全下可以立刻给对手施加极大的压力。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A fierce counter-attack! Shoving a strong hand puts immense pressure on your opponent immediately."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "非常棒的 3Bet！面对偷盲，用强牌反击获取价值。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Awesome 3Bet! Counter-attacking a steal with a strong hand for value."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "非常棒的施压！用大牌偷盲，被跟注后在翻后也有极大优势。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Excellent pressure! Stealing with a big hand gives you a massive postflop advantage if called."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "非常理智的弃牌，这个面的赔率已经不适合继续玩下去了。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Very rational fold. The odds on this board no longer justify continuing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "面对不利局势果断弃牌，在短码阶段每一分筹码都很宝贵。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Decisive fold in an unfavorable spot. Every chip is precious when short-stacked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "面对前位加注，拿到强牌果断 3Bet 是正确的，不要给对手看便宜翻牌的机会。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When facing an early position raise, 3Betting a strong hand is correct. Don't give your opponents a cheap flop."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "面对前位加注，练习你的3Bet决策。附带教练点评。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Practice your 3Bet decisions facing early position raises. Coach comments included."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "面对加注弃牌过频，未能利用你的强牌范围捍卫底池。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You fold too frequently to raises, failing to defend the pot with your strong range."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "面对大盲注，用可玩性强的手牌进行偷盲是非常标准的打法。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Against the big blind, stealing with a playable hand is a very standard move."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "面对松凶玩家的偷盲加注弃掉了坚果牌，这是对筹码的严重浪费！" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folding a monster hand to a loose-aggressive stealer is a severe waste of chips!"
